:: StoryTitle
The Bakery

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "D674C58C-DEFA-4F70-B7A2-27742230C0FC",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3",
  "start": "Street"
}

:: StoryInit
<<set $coins to 2>>

:: Street [outside]
You stand outside a bakery. [img[media/shop.png]]
[[Go in|Bakery]]

:: Bakery
<<if $coins gte 3>>The baker slides a warm loaf across the counter.
[[Buy the loaf|Home][$coins -= 3; $bread to true]]
<<else>>"Three coins," the baker says. You count <<print $coins>>.<</if>>
[[Leave|Street]]

:: Home [inside]
<img src="media/home.jpg" alt="Your kitchen">
<<if $bread>>You eat the bread & smile.<</if>>

:: Story Stylesheet [stylesheet]
body { background: url("media/paper.png"); }

:: Story JavaScript [script]
setup.price = 3;
